ession"},{"text":"Logistic regression"},{"text":"Time-series analysis"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Experimental design"},{"text":"Causal reasoning fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Modelling"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Star schema"},{"text":"Fact tables"},{"text":"Dimension tables"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"ETL/ELT fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud/Data Platforms"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS/Azure/GCP fundamentals"},{"text":"Cloud databases"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"BigQuery/Snowflake/Redshift concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Advanced Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced SQL"},{"text":"Advanced Power BI"},{"text":"Python analytics"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Customer analytics"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"},{"text":"Financial analytics"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Analytics engineering fundamentals"},{"text":"AI-assisted analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Final-year projects could include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"E-commerce sales analytics"},{"text":"Customer churn analysis"},{"text":"Banking transaction analysis"},{"text":"Healthcare analytics"},{"text":"Marketing campaign analysis"},{"text":"Product analytics dashboard"},{"text":"Supply-chain analytics"},{"text":"HR analytics"},{"text":"Sports analytics"},{"text":"Financial performance dashboard"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4-Year Honours / Advanced Track"},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Git"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Data extraction"},{"text":"Data cleaning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistical inference"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"Data storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Engineering Awareness"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ETL/ELT"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"Cloud databases"},{"text":"Data pipelines"},{"text":"Data quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"KPI development"},{"text":"Business metrics"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Customer analytics"},{"text":"Financial analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Business performance and decision-making"}],[{"text":"Product Analytics"},{"text":"User behaviour and product performance"}],[{"text":"Marketing Analytics"},{"text":"Campaigns, customers and acquisition"}],[{"text":"Financial Analytics"},{"text":"Revenue, costs and financial performance"}],[{"text":"Healthcare Analytics"},{"text":"Healthcare and patient data"}],[{"text":"E-commerce Analytics"},{"text":"Sales, customers and conversion"}],[{"text":"Sports Analytics"},{"text":"Team/player/performance data"}],[{"text":"Operations Analytics"},{"text":"Supply chain and operational efficiency"}],[{"text":"HR Analytics"},{"text":"Workforce and employee data"}],[{"text":"Risk Analytics"},{"text":"Financial and operational risk"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"College research projects"},{"text":"Small businesses"},{"text":"Student analytics projects"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Data cleaning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Analytics teams"},{"text":"Digital companies"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"},{"text":"Marketing agencies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Dashboards"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Business reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Product companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product/business analytics"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Advanced dashboards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data analytics teams"},{"text":"Business intelligence teams"},{"text":"Product analytics teams"},{"text":"Data-driven companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Aim to own an end-to-end analytics project with measurable business impact."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python for Data Analysis"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Looker Studio"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS analytics fundamentals"},{"text":"Azure data fundamentals"},{"text":"Google Cloud data fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Databases"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"MySQL"},{"text":"SQL optimisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"},{"text":"Data modelling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications can help with structured learning, but employers will generally place greater value on SQL proficiency, analytical reasoning, dashboards and real project evidence."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Entry-Level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Junior Data Analyst"},{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Reporting Analyst"},{"text":"MIS Analyst"},{"text":"Business Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"Data Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Analytics Associate"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Research Data Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Data Analyst"},{"text":"Business Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"Product Data Analyst"},{"text":"Marketing Data Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Data Analyst"},{"text":"Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Data Analytics Specialist"},{"text":"BI Developer"},{"text":"Analytics Consultant"},{"text":"Product Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Data Analyst"},{"text":"Lead Data Analyst"},{"text":"Analytics Lead"},{"text":"BI Lead"},{"text":"Analytics Consultant"},{"text":"Senior Product Analyst"},{"text":"Analytics Manager"},{"text":"Data Analytics Manager"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Leadership"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Head of Analytics"},{"text":"Director of Analytics"},{"text":"Head of Business Intelligence"},{"text":"Analytics Director"},{"text":"Chief Data/Analytics Officer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers Usually Test"},{"type":"p","text":"Employers commonly assess:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Power BI/Tableau"},{"text":"Business reasoning"},{"text":"KPI interpretation"},{"text":"Analytical thinking"},{"text":"Problem solving"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Case-study analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Scenario"},{"type":"p","text":"An e-commerce company reports that revenue increased by 20%, but profit declined."},{"type":"p","text":"A good Data Analyst should investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue by product/category."},{"text":"Sales volume versus price changes."},{"text":"Discounts and promotions."},{"text":"Cost of goods sold."},{"text":"Customer acquisition costs."},{"text":"Returns and refunds."},{"text":"Shipping costs."},{"text":"Product-level margins."},{"text":"Customer segments."},{"text":"Channel performance."},{"text":"Changes over time."},{"text":"Statistical or operational anomalies."}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is not simply to report that revenue increased. The analyst must determine what caused the change and what management should do next."},{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public-Sector Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential environments include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government analytics teams"},{"text":"Public-sector IT"},{"text":"Banking/public finance"},{"text":"Healthcare analytics"},{"text":"Education analytics"},{"text":"Census and demographic analysis"},{"text":"Transport analytics"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"Digital-government programmes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","Data Analytics Internship","Data Analyst","Senior Analyst","Analytics Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"Government eligibility varies by organisation. Some technical/statistical posts may specifically require particular degrees such as Statistics, Mathematics, Computer Science, MCA or related qualifications."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant options:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MCA"},{"text":"M.Sc Data Science"},{"text":"M.Sc Data Analytics"},{"text":"M.Sc Statistics"},{"text":"M.Sc Applied Statistics"},{"text":"M.Sc Computer Science"},{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"MBA Analytics"},{"text":"PG Diploma in Data Analytics"},{"text":"PG Diploma in Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Choice by Goal"},{"type":"table","header":["Goal","Recommended PG"],"rows":[[{"text":"General analytics"},{"text":"M.Sc Data Analytics"}],[{"text":"Data science"},{"text":"M.Sc Data Science"}],[{"text":"Statistical analytics"},{"text":"M.Sc Statistics"}],[{"text":"Advanced computing"},{"text":"MCA / M.Sc CS"}],[{"text":"Business leadership"},{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"}],[{"text":"Product/business analytics"},{"text":"MBA Analytics"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"M.Sc → PhD"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"A PG is not mandatory for entry-level Data Analyst roles. Strong SQL, statistics, Python, BI tools and practical projects can be sufficient for many positions."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"France"},{"text":"Sweden"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant master's programs:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Applied Statistics"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Business Intelligence"},{"text":"Information Systems"},{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The combination of BCA + analytics + statistics + programming can provide a good foundation for advanced analytics and data-science study."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Experience","Typical Position"],"rows":[[{"text":"0–1 year"},{"text":"Intern / Junior Data Analyst"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Data Analyst"}],[{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Senior Data Analyst"}],[{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Lead Analyst / Analytics Consultant"}],[{"text":"10–15 years"},{"text":"Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"Analytics Director / Head of Analytics"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Some professionals transition into:"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analyst → Data Scientist"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analyst → Analytics Engineer"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analyst → Product Manager / Business Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"depending on interests and additional skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Research Opportunities"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistical modelling"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Business intelligence"},{"text":"Customer analytics"},{"text":"Time-series forecasting"},{"text":"Causal inference"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Natural-language analytics"},{"text":"Healthcare analytics"},{"text":"Financial analytics"},{"text":"Operations research"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"},{"text":"Decision science"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future Skills — 2030+"},{"type":"p","text":"Data Analysts will increasingly work alongside AI systems, but the core analytical responsibilities remain important."},{"type":"p","text":"Future skills include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted analytics"},{"text":"Natural-language querying"},{"text":"Automated data preparation"},{"text":"Advanced SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Statistical modelling"},{"text":"Causal inference"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Analytics engineering"},{"text":"Cloud data platforms"},{"text":"Semantic layers"},{"text":"Business intelligence"},{"text":"Decision intelligence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The key transition will be from \"creating reports\" → \"explaining business outcomes and recommending decisions.\""},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Outlook"},{"type":"p","text":"AI will automate many routine dashboard-building, querying and basic reporting tasks. Human analysts will increasingly be responsible for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Defining the right question"},{"text":"Selecting appropriate metrics"},{"text":"Validating data"},{"text":"Designing experiments"},{"text":"Interpreting uncertainty"},{"text":"Identifying causal factors"},{"text":"Challenging misleading conclusions"},{"text":"Communicating recommendations"},{"text":"Making business decisions from evidence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest Data Analysts will therefore become decision-support professionals rather than report generators."},{"type":"h","text":"Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data Cleaning"},{"text":"pandas/NumPy"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau/BI"},{"text":"Data Visualisation"},{"text":"Data Modelling"},{"text":"Business Analysis"},{"text":"A/B Testing"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Cloud Data Platforms"},{"text":"ETL/ELT Fundamentals"},{"text":"Data Storytelling"},{"text":"AI-Assisted Analytics"},{"text":"Communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["BCA Data Science / Analytics Graduate","Data Analytics Intern","Junior Data Analyst","Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Analytics Lead","Analytics Manager / Analytics Consultant"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest candidate should graduate with advanced SQL, solid statistics, Python/pandas, Power BI, business reasoning and several end-to-end projects. The differentiator is not merely producing dashboards—it is being able to identify the business problem, analyse reliable data, explain why something happened, and recommend what should happen next."}]}]}